    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock Quest: A Rhythm Adventure</strong> is a genre-smashing fusion of rhythm action and adventure, set in a warped, near-future New Orleans where music might be your only hope of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a four-piece rock band caught in the chaos of a city overrun by cyborg rats, secret experiments, and creeping authoritarian control. With the President declaring martial law and paranormal anomalies on the rise, you and your bandmates must journey through jazz-haunted streets to uncover the truth\u2014and melt some faces along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Rhythm-Based Combat</strong>: Every battle is a musical showdown. Hit notes in time to deal damage\u2014miss, and the beat hits back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>: A blistering garage punk score fuels every fight\u2014 jagged guitars, pounding drums, and relentless bass drive the action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a gig. It\u2019s a <strong>quest</strong>.<br>Grab your gear. Find your sound. Fight the system.<br>Welcome to <strong>Rock Quest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695470/extras/97a86a4f85d6f3ab8d9f599fcc9c6e73.avif?t=1753432493\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock Quest: A Rhythm Adventure</strong> is a genre-smashing fusion of rhythm action and adventure, set in a warped, near-future New Orleans where music might be your only hope of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a four-piece rock band caught in the chaos of a city overrun by cyborg rats, secret experiments, and creeping authoritarian control. With the President declaring martial law and paranormal anomalies on the rise, you and your bandmates must journey through jazz-haunted streets to uncover the truth\u2014and melt some faces along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Rhythm-Based Combat</strong>: Every battle is a musical showdown. Hit notes in time to deal damage\u2014miss, and the beat hits back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>: A blistering garage punk score fuels every fight\u2014 jagged guitars, pounding drums, and relentless bass drive the action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a gig. It\u2019s a <strong>quest</strong>.<br>Grab your gear. Find your sound. Fight the system.<br>Welcome to <strong>Rock Quest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695470/extras/97a86a4f85d6f3ab8d9f599fcc9c6e73.avif?t=1753432493\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
